{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「社团长这差事你行吗？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0570", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没问题！应该吧……」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5215", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明胸比美羽羽小得多」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0571", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟、跟那个没关系吧」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5216", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最重要的是，\\n　新吾就喜欢小的，所以没问题」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "「最重要的是，　新吾就喜欢小的，所以没问题」", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7544", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽说是这么回事，但也不用在这说出来吧」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用在意这些小问题」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7545", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "趁着假期，我们三个人一起出来购物。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪说她已经不会再穿男装了。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在说自己已经没必要那么做时，显得十分高兴。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样三个人一起牵着手走在路上，\\n　就像一家三口呢」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「这样三个人一起牵着手走在路上，　就像一家三口呢」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5218", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪站在理央两边，各牵着他一只手。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么一说倒确实。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾是爸爸」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0572", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妈妈死了」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0573", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾是爸爸那我就该是妈妈才对吧。\\n　别擅自让我去世啊」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "「新吾是爸爸那我就该是妈妈才对吧。　别擅自让我去世啊」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5219", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算妈妈不在了我也不觉得寂寞」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0574", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算她不在也没关系」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0575", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5220", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央的话里，\\n带着对他真正的母亲的思绪。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "理央的话里，带着对他真正的母亲的思绪。", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算妈妈不在了，也还有温柔的姐姐在哦～」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5221", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然胸小得不行呢」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0576", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都说了和胸的大小没关系吧」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5222", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪小小的胸我也很喜欢」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别一个劲地在那说小啊！」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5223", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你给我记住了。\\n　等会儿我会狠狠地教训你的……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「新吾你给我记住了。　等会儿我会狠狠地教训你的……」", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5224", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是个糟糕至极的社团长啊」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0577", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是个让人头疼的社团长啊」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，还不是怪你们俩男生伙同起来欺负我……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5225", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两个男生和一个女生，\\n确实容易出现失衡的状态。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "两个男生和一个女生，确实容易出现失衡的状态。", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央也正处在羞于向家人表达感情的年龄。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你们好好想想。\\n　我是社团长，而新吾是副社团长，\\n　怎么看都是我更厉害吧？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「你们好好想想。　我是社团长，而新吾是副社团长，　怎么看都是我更厉害吧？」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5226", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实是这样」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，因此我的命令是绝对的……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5227", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「肯定又在想什么不正经的事」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0578", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要你管～\\n　只是想想又怎么了嘛，又不会做」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「要你管～　只是想想又怎么了嘛，又不会做」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5228", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你想了什么？」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「羞、羞死人了，我说不出口」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5229", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在她的幻想里到底对我下了什么命令呢？", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光想想我就有些害怕。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「让这人当社团长真的没问题吗？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0579", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，没问题吧。\\n　今后我会和她一起努力的」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "「嗯，没问题吧。　今后我会和她一起努力的」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦，要加油做吗？\\n　等一下嘛，这么突然，讨厌……」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「咦，要加油做吗？　等一下嘛，这么突然，讨厌……」", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5230", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪还在幻想的世界里遨游。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来是又给我下了什么新命令。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，祝你们幸福」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0580", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央甩开了我们俩的手，\\n一个人走在前面。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "理央甩开了我们俩的手，一个人走在前面。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已经腻了，回去了」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0581", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么就腻了，不是还什么都没买吗？\\n　你不是想要动物书吗？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「怎么就腻了，不是还什么都没买吗？　你不是想要动物书吗？」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5231", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不需要」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0582", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央回答得有些冷淡，\\n但我们却有种莫名的熟悉感。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "理央回答得有些冷淡，但我们却有种莫名的熟悉感。", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熟悉感？", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "啊，这样啊。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是个会看气氛的男人」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0583", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「以后我要成为新吾那样的人」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0584", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新、新吾那样的人……」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5232", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真头疼啊」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来还不用我说，\\n　他就自己朝那个努力了」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "「看来还不用我说，　他就自己朝那个努力了」", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5233", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也不好说让他不要成为我这样的人，\\n感到有些害羞。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "我也不好说让他不要成为我这样的人，感到有些害羞。", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪也露出了满足的微笑。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「理央」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5234", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0585", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪叫着理央，接着紧紧地贴在了我身边。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你啊」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5235", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一定要成为一个好男人啊」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5236", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这不是社团长的命令，而是姐姐的要求」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5237", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央听到这话，依然是平时那副平静的模样。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你也一样」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0586", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说着，理央露出了和纱凪一样的笑容。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「姐姐也一样要成为一个好女人啊」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ri0587", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、好了，就这样」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5238", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "上午在约会，下午则是在照顾动物们。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪成为社团长后，做事越发地积极努力了。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天这么黑了，先回去吧？」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……可是我们这样真的好吗？」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5239", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你指什么？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我们都没什么时间能去好好地约个会，\\n　新吾觉得没关系吗？和我交往开心吗？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "「因为我们都没什么时间能去好好地约个会，　新吾觉得没关系吗？和我交往开心吗？」", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5240", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们和街上靓丽的情侣们不一样。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得负责动物的吃喝拉撒，\\n弄得满脸脏。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "得负责动物的吃喝拉撒，弄得满脸脏。", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两个人每天都过着这种日子。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我很幸福」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明在问我开不开心，我却给出了这样的回答。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也想不到除此之外的答案。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也很幸福……我们一样呢」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7546", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，一样呢」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以这样就好。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们会这样一直走下去。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很好～今后我还会发布更多社团长的命令～」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5242", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那倒是无所谓，不过不可以滥用职权啊」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我才不会呢。\\n　先给我来一个强硬的吻吧」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「我才不会呢。　先给我来一个强硬的吻吧」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5243", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这就开始滥用了吗。而且为什么要强硬的？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是个人的喜好」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5244", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们的社团长真让人无可奈何啊。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「社团长的命令不能违抗吗？」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，不能」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5245", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就没办法了」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我面向纱凪，抱住了她的肩。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5246", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看着闭着眼睛等待我亲过去的纱凪，\\n觉得实在可爱，不由得想多等一会。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "我看着闭着眼睛等待我亲过去的纱凪，觉得实在可爱，不由得想多等一会。", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还没好吗～」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5247", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还没～」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "实在太好笑了，我下意识地捂住了自己的嘴。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「根本没有亲过来的意思啊！\\n　为什么要让我一直撅着嘴等你啊？！」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": "「根本没有亲过来的意思啊！　为什么要让我一直撅着嘴等你啊？！」", "plain_idx": 363, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5248", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，个人的喜好？」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜欢把女朋友放着不管是哪门子的男朋友啊！」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn5249", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然在这些小事上我们会有“不同”的看法。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我们依然有许多相似的地方。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想，今后彼此相似的点也会越来越多。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们今后也会不断寻找“这样”的幸福。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
